# .github/CODEOWNERS
# Anything that decides what is fetched, how it is judged or what is published needs a review by the code owner (ruleset: require_code_owner_review).
# An invalid owner makes GitHub ignore the line silently: after merging, check `gh api repos/MacGuard/macguard-yara-channel/codeowners/errors` (expect "errors": []).
# Last matching pattern wins. /logs/ is deliberately not listed: the transparency log lives on its own branch (`logs`) and is written by the log bot, not reviewed.
